// sensor grid     → LineSegments, (N+1)+(M+1) lines, #8A9099, plane z = -f
// sensor pixels   → vertex-coloured quad BufferGeometry (green/yellow/red, inverted)
// principal point → Sphere r.05 black at (0,0,-f)
// w tick          → thin cylinder r.012 black below sensor
// f dimension     → double-headed arrow z=-f → 0, black
// virtual plane   → PlaneGeometry(w,h) #DDE4E6 55% + 4-cylinder border #5A6468
// local x,y axes  → green (#1FBF1F) arrows + right-angle L marker
// scene plane     → PlaneGeometry(3.6,3.0) #A9E8A0 at z=+6.5
