// @FIGURE_CODE_BEGIN
/* ── element spec ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Zc axis         → cylinder r.028 + cone head, black, z = -f-0.5 … +9   (screen right)
// Yc axis         → cylinder + cone, black, y = -2.6 … +3.3              (screen up)
// Xc axis         → cylinder + cone, black, origin → X = 2.5             (screen up-right ~40°)
// camera center   → Sphere r.105 black at origin + thin gray leader arrow
// sensor grid     → LineSegments (N+1)+(M+1) lines, #8A9099, plane z = -f
// sensor pixels   → vertex-coloured quad BufferGeometry (green/yellow/red, inverted)
// principal point → Sphere r.055 black at (0,0,-f), offset inside grid via (ox,oy)
// w tick          → thin cylinder r.012 black below sensor
// f dimension     → double-headed arrow z=-f → 0, black
// virtual plane   → PlaneGeometry(w,h) #DDE4E6 55% + 4-cylinder border #5A6468
// local x,y axes  → green (#1FBF1F) arrows + right-angle L marker
// scene plane     → PlaneGeometry(3.6,3.0) #A9E8A0 at z=+6.5, centre (-0.45,0.35)
// windows         → 4 × PlaneGeometry(.7,.7) #F2C21E
