// Zc axis          → cylinder r.034 + cone head, black, z = -f-0.5 … +7.5   (screen right)
// Yc axis          → cylinder + cone, black, y = -2.8 … +3.1                (screen up)
// Xc axis          → cylinder + cone, black, origin → X = 2.2               (screen up-right ~40°)
// camera center    → Sphere r.115 black at origin + thin gray leader arrow
// sensor grid      → LineSegments (N+1)+(M+1) lines #7A828C, plane z = -f, w=3.8 h=2.85
// sensor pixels    → vertex-coloured quad BufferGeometry (green/yellow/red, inverted)
// principal point  → Sphere r.06 black at (0,0,-f), offset inside grid via (ox,oy)
// w tick           → thin cylinder r.013 black below sensor
// f dimension      → double-headed arrow z=-f → 0, black
// virtual plane    → PlaneGeometry(w,h) #DDE4E6 55% + 4-cylinder border #5A6468 r.035
// local x,y axes   → green (#1FBF1F) arrows r.026 + right-angle L marker
