    title: 'Scene plane', tooltip: 'The 3-D object being imaged',
    body: 'A planar object standing in the world at Z = 5. Every point on it is projected through the camera centre onto the image planes; the physical sensor receives the 180°-rotated (inverted) copy.'
  });
